@startuml obelisk_component
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 140
package "Renderer (sandboxed, one per window)" {
  [Shell and Tabs] as Shell
  [EditorCore] as Core
  [BlockViews] as Views
  [FormulaRenderer] as Formula
  [ClipboardBridge] as Clip
  [AutosaveService] as Auto
}
package "Preload" {
  [IPC bridge] as IPC
}
package "Main process" {
  [FileService] as Files
  [FormatCodec] as Codec
  [ExportService] as Export
  [SignatureStore] as Sig
  [PreferencesStore] as Prefs
  [RecoveryService] as Rec
}
Shell --> Core
Core --> Views
Views --> Formula
Core --> Clip
Core --> Auto
Shell --> IPC
Core --> IPC
Auto --> IPC : file:save, recovery:put
IPC --> Files : open, save, handles
IPC --> Export : export:run
IPC --> Sig : sig:*
IPC --> Prefs : prefs:*, session:set
IPC --> Rec : recovery:*
Files --> Codec : encode, decode, checks
Rec --> Codec : checks on restore
Export --> Codec
Export --> Files : writeAtomic
Sig --> Files : writeAtomic
Prefs --> Files : writeAtomic
Rec --> Files : writeAtomic
legend bottom
 Only the main process touches the disk (ADR-001, NFR-22).
 Save, Save As, and autosave share file:save; every write uses FileService.writeAtomic (ADR-002).
 The renderer sends handles and IDs, never paths. Single instance and recovery: ADR-009.
endlegend
@enduml
